  "description": {
    "text": "Champions League 2023 Yokohama, the first tournament of the 2023 season, was held at Pacifico Yokohama on 17 and 18 September 2022, without spectators, with the master league alone on the first day. From this season the Champions League gave no Championship Points; the top four of each league were invited to the 2023 World Championships. Its top finishers in each league won Victory Proof in a print for their place: Champion, 2nd Place, or 3rd Place for both the third and fourth.",
